        <field name="image_1920" type="bytes" file="art_craft/static/src/binary/product_template/27-image_1920.jpg"/>
        <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p><font class="text-800">Crafted from premium, sustainably sourced beechwood, this easel combines elegant design with robust functionality, making it an essential centerpiece for any artist's studio.</font><br><br><strong><font class="text-black">Key features:</font></strong></p>


<ul><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Type:</strong></font><font class="text-o-color-5"> </font><font class="text-800">Classic Tripod A-Frame Studio Easel.</font></li><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">Material:</font></strong> <font class="text-800">Premium, sustainably sourced solid Beechwood with a natural light-oil finish.</font></li><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">Maximum Canvas Height:</font></strong> <font class="text-800">Accommodates canvases up to <strong>120 cm (47 inches)</strong> tall.</font></li><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">Base Footprint:</font></strong> <font class="text-800">Approximately <strong>95 cm x 75 cm</strong> when fully extended for maximum stability.</font></li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Total Height:</strong> </font><font class="text-800">Adjustable from <strong>150 cm to 230 cm</strong> depending on mast extension.</font></li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Weight:</strong> </font><font class="text-800">Approximately <strong>6.5 kg</strong>, providing a sturdy foundation while remaining portable within the studio.</font></li><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">Hardware:</font></strong> <font class="text-800">Corrosion-resistant polished brass knobs and fittings for smooth height and tilt adjustments.</font></li></ul>]]></field>
        <field name="website_description"><![CDATA[<section class="s_text_image pt80 pb80 o_colored_level o_cc o_cc4" data-snippet="s_text_image" data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;html_builder/Miscellaneous/05&quot;,&quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c3&quot;:&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;,&quot;c4&quot;:&quot;o-color-4&quot;},&quot;flip&quot;:[&quot;y&quot;],&quot;showOnMobile&quot;:false,&quot;shapeAnimationSpeed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;selectedColor&quot;:true}" style="position: relative; background-color: transparent; background-image: linear-gradient(0deg, rgb(255, 255, 255) 0%, rgb(245, 250, 250) 3%, rgb(213, 232, 233) 29%, rgb(209, 230, 231) 100%);" data-name="Text - Image"><div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Miscellaneous_05" style="background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder%2FMiscellaneous%2F05.svg?c3=%23FFFFFF&amp;c4=%23FFFFFF&amp;flip=y&quot;); background-position: 50% 0%;"></div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row align-items-end">
                <div class="pt16 pb16 o_colored_level col-lg-5"><h2><span class="h2-fs">​Rock-Solid and<span data-text-effect="{&quot;preset&quot;:&quot;custom&quot;,&quot;shadows&quot;:[{&quot;shadowColor&quot;:&quot;var(--o-color-2)&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetX&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetY&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowBlur&quot;:&quot;0px&quot;}],&quot;presetHash&quot;:&quot;86863946&quot;}" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--o-color-2);"> Top Quality</span></span></h2><p>
                    </p><p><span><span><em>"I recently upgraded my home studio with this A-frame easel, and the difference is night and day. The first thing I noticed was the quality of the beechwood, t’s incredibly smooth and has a beautiful, sturdy feel that you just don't get with cheaper pine models.</em><br><em>Assembly was straightforward, and the brass hardware feels very premium. What I love most is how stable it is; even when I’m working on a larger 40" canvas and being quite vigorous with my brushwork, there’s no wobbling at all. The adjustable ledge is a lifesaver for switching between sitting and standing while I paint."</em></span></span></p><p><span><span><em><strong>— Sarah J., Verified Buyer</strong></em></span></span><span data-text-effect="{&quot;preset&quot;:&quot;custom&quot;,&quot;shadows&quot;:[{&quot;shadowColor&quot;:&quot;var(--o-color-2)&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetX&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetY&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowBlur&quot;:&quot;0px&quot;}],&quot;presetHash&quot;:&quot;86863946&quot;}" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--o-color-2);"><span data-text-effect="{&quot;preset&quot;:&quot;custom&quot;,&quot;shadows&quot;:[{&quot;shadowColor&quot;:&quot;var(--o-color-2)&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetX&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowOffsetY&quot;:&quot;2px&quot;,&quot;shadowBlur&quot;:&quot;0px&quot;}],&quot;presetHash&quot;:&quot;86863946&quot;}" style="text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px var(--o-color-2);"><br><br></span></span><br></p>
                </div>
                <div class="pt16 pb16 o_colored_level col-lg-5 offset-lg-2"><img src="/web/image/art_craft.ir_attachment_1725" alt="" class="img img-fluid mx-auto rounded o_we_custom_image" data-format-mimetype="image/webp" data-resize-width="690" data-mimetype="image/svg+xml" loading="lazy" data-quality="100" data-shape="html_builder/geometric/geo_door" data-aspect-ratio="1/1">
