        <field name="description_ecommerce"><![CDATA[<p>Bring your creativity to life with this <font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>6-colors acrylic paint set</strong>,</font> featuring a versatile selection of rich, vibrant shades for painting, crafting, and DIY projects. Each color comes in a convenient <strong>easy-to-use tube</strong>, making it simple to squeeze out just the right amount of paint while keeping the rest fresh and ready for your next project.</p>
<p><strong><font class="text-900">What’s Inside:</font></strong></p>
<ul><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">6 vibrant color</font>s</strong> – A versatile range for creating colorful artwork and unique combinations.</li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Convenient tube packaging</strong> </font>– Easy to squeeze, control, and store.</li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Smooth acrylic formula</strong> </font>– Ideal for creating even coverage and expressive brushstrokes.</li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Versatile use</strong> </font>– Suitable for canvas, paper, wood, crafts, and other suitable painting surfaces.</li><li><strong><font class="text-o-color-3">Great for all skill levels</font></strong> – Perfect for beginners, hobby artists, students, and creative enthusiasts.</li><li><font class="text-o-color-3"><strong>Mix and match</strong> </font>– Blend colors together to create custom shades and beautiful effects.</li></ul>]]></field>
        <field name="website_description"><![CDATA[<section class="s_text_image pt80 pb80 o_colored_level o_cc o_cc4" data-snippet="s_text_image" data-oe-shape-data="{&quot;shape&quot;:&quot;html_builder/Miscellaneous/05&quot;,&quot;colors&quot;:{&quot;c3&quot;:&quot;#FFFFFF&quot;,&quot;c4&quot;:&quot;o-color-4&quot;},&quot;flip&quot;:[&quot;y&quot;],&quot;showOnMobile&quot;:false,&quot;shapeAnimationSpeed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;selectedColor&quot;:true}" style="position: relative; background-color: transparent; background-image: linear-gradient(0deg, rgb(255, 255, 255) 0%, rgb(245, 250, 250) 3%, rgb(213, 232, 233) 29%, rgb(209, 230, 231) 100%);" data-name="Text - Image"><div class="o_we_shape o_html_builder_Miscellaneous_05" style="background-image: url(&quot;/html_editor/shape/html_builder%2FMiscellaneous%2F05.svg?c3=%23FFFFFF&amp;c4=%23FFFFFF&amp;flip=y&quot;); background-position: 50% 0%;"></div>
        <div class="container">
